+-- The sheet's policy date: a claim dated before it rounds its live figures half up, one dated on or
+-- after it half to even (a correction by the date of the claim it corrects). Null means the sheet's
+-- today. Settled and stated figures keep what they were fixed at.
+ALTER TABLE sheet ADD COLUMN policy_date DATE;
